{
  "name": "one role is offered remotely in several countries and onsite at two offices",
  "description": "ADR-0024 decisions 1 to 4, and the hirer bodies of its Implementation.\n\nBefore this, 'remote, or at either office' was three roles, splitting one job's candidates three ways. Now one role holds a SET of entries: here, remote in Germany, remote in India, onsite at the Bengaluru main office and onsite at Austin. Remote is country only — it never points at an address, so a company may offer remote work in Germany where it has no office. Onsite always points at one of the organisation's own addresses and names no country of its own; its country is the address's.\n\nThe request below is deliberately untidy: lower-case 'in', India twice, Austin twice, and the entries out of order. A repeated entry is COLLAPSED, not refused (decision 3) — a form that sends 'India, India' has not made a mistake worth a 422 — and the response is in the one order two reads must agree on: remote first, then by country, then by city. Every hirer entry carries `mode`, `country` and `address`, the address embedded in full.\n\nEntries share the role's immutability (decision 4): written on create, replaced wholesale on a draft's PATCH, carried by open, and changed after opening only by revise — which writes a new role and leaves the original's entries exactly as they were.",
  "seed": ["principals"],
  "steps": [
    {
      "_step": "Six entries sent, four kept: 'in' and 'IN' are one country, and Austin twice is one office.",
      "as": "hank",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/org-roles/01920000-0000-7000-8000-00000000b001/roles",
        "body": {
          "title": "Site reliability engineer",
          "engagement": "full_time",
          "locations": [
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "{{acme.address.austin}}"
            },
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "in"
            },
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "{{acme.address.main}}"
            },
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "DE"
            },
            {
              "mode": "remote",
              "country": "IN"
            },
            {
              "mode": "onsite",
              "address_id": "{{acme.address.austin}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "capture": {
        "role": "$.id"
      },
      "expect": {
        "status": 201,
        "_note": "Remote first (DE, IN), then onsite by country and city (IN Bengaluru, US Austin). The onsite entries' country is null: an onsite entry names no country of its own.",
        "body": {
